## Negative findings - why this file is `.md.excluded`

As of 2026-10-05, no verified public benchmark scores exist for `grok-build-0.1`:

- SpaceXAI's May 29, 2026 API post (x.ai/news/grok-build-0-1) gives specs — coding model trained for agentic coding, text+image in / text out, 100+ t/s, $1/$2 per 1M, 256K context, early access — but publishes no benchmark table.
- BenchLM tracks only a single source-displayable benchmark row with no public overall score.
- No SWE-bench Verified / Terminal-Bench / GDPval row for the exact id `grok-build-0.1` exists on AA, vals.ai, or TrendRadar.
- The sibling `grok-build` harness itself has no independent scorecard either.

Writing normalized 1–100 scores would be invention; re-research if a public scorecard appears.
